  "implemented": [
    "Combine explicitly reviewed inventory worksheets into one inventory, with editable locations per sheet",
    "Preserve other sheet mappings, edited rows and selection when switching; mixed-purpose data sheets are not automatically selected",
    "Add new document items to a permitted existing inventory with current version, active state and named granular permissions",
    "Explicitly refresh inventory destinations without dropping edited mappings or silently updating a reviewed save version",
    "Preserve existing items, saved verification, fixed task scope, custom schema, categories and Fleet custody",
    "Atomic add-only imports and exact receipt retries; duplicate or uncertain overlapping source rows stop the whole batch",
    "Native optional part_number field alongside serial and asset, identity aliases and exact leading-zero strings",
    "PN in item editor/list/details, scoped/private verification, asset/Fleet displays, native packages, CSV and relevant PDF reports",
    "Punctuated identifiers match as one token; normal multiword AND, compact and accent-tolerant searches remain",
    "Original mapped locations and prior Counted values stay source evidence; ambiguous expected quantities remain Unknown",
    "Existing auth/mail/recovery/tab/reload/native-log designs, SQL definitions, source dependencies and 72 art files retained"
  ],
